  "bodyHtml": "\n\n\t\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-168842638426899e3410/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>Michael Rudden</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2025-11-08T14:49:43-05:00\" title=\"Saturday, November 8, 2025, 2:49 pm\">November 8, 2025</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-content\">\n\t\t\t<p>This year’s Annual Member’s Meeting was held in the newly renovated Bank Street Firehouse.  Over 40 members and their quest attended the catered affair in what proved to be a successful outing ushering in a new and creative way for members to socialize.  It looks like the Guild has finally found a permanent home for our long tradition of a fall dinner. The firehouse renovation was the result of a collaboration of  the <span><a class=\"H23r4e\" href=\"https://harwichconservationtrust.org/cold-brook-eco-restoration-project/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Harwich Conservation Trust</a></span> and <span><a class=\"H23r4e\" href=\"https://www.facebook.com/harwichfireassociation/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Harwich Fire Association,</a></span> <mark class=\"HxTRcb\">creating a multi-purpose community space, museum, and three one-bed <img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-7374\" src=\"/media/archive/edb04801f981e621688bd9292309b8e360dbda6f9b8d73c2263cb92247d2deda.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"225\" loading=\"lazy\" /> <img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-7375\" src=\"/media/archive/f39c4fab9af79d2b5b638c0e91028a6d7bb69c634a7b5559dba0b22bfaffd887.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"225\" loading=\"lazy\" /> <img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-7376\" src=\"/media/archive/7c2587c72d2d807c42ceeb6aaaca89cc916802f025db81b1bbc7926cdc3e1f25.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"225\" loading=\"lazy\" /> <img loading=\"lazy\" class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-7377\" src=\"/media/archive/af81ffaaaf54c802448b7af6127ed1ee1a5acfd7d52be38fe416707035ab63a4.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"225\" /> <img loading=\"lazy\" class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-7378\" src=\"/media/archive/a078043a62d685a46ce723acd6296b7387714d51aa6c48e9db2c6cd367c1f8c8.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"225\" />room affordable apartments</mark>.</p>\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t<footer class=\"entry-footer\">\n\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-terms category\">Posted in <a href=\"/archive/source-e23b79be08a822c7b682/\" rel=\"tag\">WHAT'S NEW</a></span>\t\t\t\t\t</footer>\n\n\t\n",
